{%- comment -%}
  Produktkarte V2.

  Der Preis folgt IMMER einer konkreten Variante – niemals einem „ab"-Preis.
  Auflösungsreihenfolge:
    1. price_context   – explizite Vorgabe der Section ('sample', 'travel', 'edp', 'extrait')
    2. Collection-Metafeld custom.karten_variante
    3. Produkt-Metafeld custom.hauptvariante
    4. erste verfügbare 30-ml-Variante
    5. erste verfügbare Variante

  Parameter:
    product, lazy, sizes, price_context, quick_add,
    show_family / show_concentration / show_badges (überschreiben die Theme Settings)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign card_lazy = lazy | default: 'lazy'
  assign card_sizes = sizes | default: '(min-width: 1200px) 22vw, (min-width: 750px) 30vw, 45vw'

  assign show_family_final = show_family
  if show_family == nil
    assign show_family_final = settings.card_show_family
  endif
  assign show_conc_final = show_concentration
  if show_concentration == nil
    assign show_conc_final = settings.card_show_concentration
  endif
  assign show_badges_final = show_badges
  if show_badges == nil
    assign show_badges_final = settings.card_show_badges
  endif

  assign context_key = price_context
  if context_key == blank
    assign context_key = collection.metafields.custom.karten_variante.value
  endif
  assign context_key = context_key | downcase | strip

  assign display_variant = blank

  comment
    1. Kontextvariante: sucht die Variante, deren Ausführung zum Kontext passt.
  endcomment
  if context_key != blank
    assign context_needle = context_key
    case context_key
      when 'sample'
        assign context_needle = 'sample'
      when 'travel'
        assign context_needle = 'travel'
      when 'edp'
        assign context_needle = 'eau de parfum'
      when 'extrait'
        assign context_needle = 'extrait'
    endcase
    for candidate in product.variants
      assign candidate_title = candidate.title | downcase
      if display_variant == blank and candidate_title contains context_needle
        assign display_variant = candidate
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  if display_variant == blank
    assign display_variant = product.metafields.custom.hauptvariante.value
  endif

  if display_variant == blank
    for candidate in product.variants
      assign candidate_title = candidate.title | downcase
      if display_variant == blank and candidate_title contains '30 ml' and candidate.available
        assign display_variant = candidate
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  if display_variant == blank
    assign display_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  endif

  assign families = product.metafields.custom.duftfamilie.value
  assign character = product.metafields.custom.charakter.value

  assign badge_label = ''
  if show_badges_final
    if product.metafields.custom.bestseller.value == true or product.tags contains 'bestseller'
      assign badge_label = 'products.product.badge_bestseller' | t
    elsif product.tags contains 'neu' or product.tags contains 'new'
      assign badge_label = 'products.product.badge_new' | t
    endif
  endif
-%}
<article class="card">
  <div class="card__media card__media--{{ settings.card_image_ratio }}">
    {%- if product.featured_media -%}
      <img
        src="{{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 800 }}"
        srcset="{{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 400 }} 400w,
                {{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w,
                {{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 800 }} 800w,
                {{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w"
        sizes="{{ card_sizes }}"
        alt="{{ product.featured_media.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
        width="{{ product.featured_media.width }}"
        height="{{ product.featured_media.height }}"
        loading="{{ card_lazy }}"
        class="card__image--primary"
      >
      {%- if settings.card_show_secondary_image and product.media[1] -%}
        <img
          src="{{ product.media[1] | image_url: width: 800 }}"
          srcset="{{ product.media[1] | image_url: width: 400 }} 400w,
                  {{ product.media[1] | image_url: width: 800 }} 800w"
          sizes="{{ card_sizes }}"
          alt=""
          width="{{ product.media[1].width }}"
          height="{{ product.media[1].height }}"
          loading="lazy"
          class="card__image--secondary"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'card__placeholder' }}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if badge_label != blank -%}
      <span class="card__badge">{{ badge_label }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  <div class="card__content">
    <h3 class="card__title">
      <a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title }}</a>
    </h3>

    {%- if show_family_final -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign card_traits = ''
        if families != blank
          assign card_traits = families | join: ' · '
        endif
        if character != blank
          assign character_text = character | join: ' · '
          if card_traits != blank
            assign card_traits = card_traits | append: ' · ' | append: character_text
          else
            assign card_traits = character_text
          endif
        endif
      -%}
      {%- if card_traits != blank -%}
        <p class="card__family">{{ card_traits }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if show_conc_final -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        Konzentration und Größe kommen aus der Variante – aus dem Metafeld,
        sonst aus dem standardisierten Variantennamen abgeleitet.
        Ein Eau de Parfum zeigt dadurch nie die Prozentzahl des Extrait.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- capture card_variant_line -%}{% render 'variant-facts', variant: display_variant, mode: 'line' %}{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- assign card_variant_line = card_variant_line | strip -%}
      {%- if card_variant_line != blank -%}
        <p class="card__meta meta">{{ card_variant_line }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- render 'product-price', variant: display_variant, product: product, class: 'card__price' -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      Schnell-hinzufügen steht bewusst UNTER den Angaben, nicht auf dem Bild:
      Das Produktfoto bleibt frei von Bedienelementen. Die Funktion selbst –
      Formular, Varianten-ID, Cart-Rückmeldung – ist unverändert.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if quick_add and display_variant.available -%}
      <form method="post" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" class="card__quick-add">
        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ display_variant.id }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
        <button
          type="submit"
          class="card__quick-add-button"
          aria-label="{{ 'sections.quick_add.label' | t }} – {{ product.title | escape }} {{ display_variant.title | escape }}"
        >
          <span class="card__quick-add-label">{{ 'sections.quick_add.label' | t }}</span>
          {% render 'icon', name: 'plus' %}
        </button>
      </form>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</article>
